      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally believe there should be alternatives that do not involve a government ID due to the simple reason that no matter how safe a company states their methods are, if they store any data, it can be breached. Either an alternative or a guarantee that absolutely no information is saved once the process is completed, including the date of birth. And that includes whatever company manages \"Persona\".",
